    "key": ".gemini/skills/spec-driven-development/references/templates/sdd-changes.md",
    "contentType": "text/markdown; charset=utf-8",
    "content": "# Spec Changes\n\nSemantic changes to the specification. Git history captures diffs; this file captures intent.\n\nEach entry is dated, ≤2 sentences, user-facing only. No commit SHAs. No \"verification pass\" entries. No spec cleanup or format fixes (those live in git history).\n\n## YYYY-MM-DD\n\n- {New requirement added: REQ-X-N — one sentence}\n- {Existing requirement changed: REQ-X-N — what changed and why it matters to users}\n",
